     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "The <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">read()</code> function is called on <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">fileobj</code>. The file's contents will be read into <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">file_str</code>."
    }
